Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:20:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Smart Edit: cut a range, regenerate only that cut, approve,
 re-stitch

- Mark a time range (and optional box) on a finished video and pick an edit:
  change, remove, outfit, new line, or re-shoot.
- Only the cut is regenerated: box edits inpaint the cut's first/last frames,
  then a hidden image-to-video child job animates between them; new lines go
  through video lip-sync.
- Before/after review; approval stitches the clip back (original soundtrack
  kept for picture edits) into a new current version. Repeatable, with the
  original plus the last 10 versions restorable.
- Credit quote and preflight, NMC/ICAI checks on edit text, stale-version
  protection, children hidden from the job list.

